00:10:08.783 --> 00:10:11.975
<v Host>From the seventh through the sixteenth of this month.

00:10:12.576 --> 00:10:18.936
<v Slow>Uターンラッシュのピークは、いつになる見込みですか。

00:10:19.735 --> 00:10:22.111
